---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Less busywork. Better systems.</span>
      <h1>Make your work flow.<br /><span class="gradient">Not your to-do list.</span></h1>
      <p>Simple workflow tools and practical automation playbooks for solo consultants and small agencies. Spend less time coordinating work and more time delivering it.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/onboarding/">Generate a client checklist <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/guides/">Explore the guides</a></div>
      <div class="micro">Free to use · No sign-up · Your inputs stay in your browser</div>
    </div>
    <div class="preview" aria-label="Example client onboarding checklist">
      <div class="preview-top"><span>CLIENT ONBOARDING / SAMPLE</span><span class="live">● Ready to start</span></div>
      <div class="task"><span class="check">✓</span><div><strong>Send welcome email</strong><small>Set expectations and introduce next steps</small></div></div>
      <div class="task"><span class="check">✓</span><div><strong>Share project brief</strong><small>Goals, audience, deliverables and success metrics</small></div></div>
      <div class="task"><span class="check empty"></span><div><strong>Collect access & assets</strong><small>Request files, brand guidelines and permissions</small></div></div>
      <div class="task"><span class="check empty"></span><div><strong>Schedule kickoff call</strong><small>Confirm timeline, roles and communication rhythm</small></div></div>
      <div class="preview-top" style="margin:20px 0 0"><span>4 starter tasks</span><span>Customize your own →</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Start with a real workflow</span><h2>Small tools. Smoother operations.</h2></div><p>Designed for the everyday friction that slows down client work: unclear handoffs, repeated follow-ups and processes living in your head.</p></div>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">↗</div><h3>Client onboarding generator</h3><p>Build a starter checklist around your service, project type and timeline in seconds.</p><a class="text-link" href="/onboarding/">Generate a checklist →</a></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">⌘</div><h3>Practical automation guides</h3><p>Step-by-step workflows that connect your tools and reduce repetitive admin without overengineering.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/">Read the guides →</a></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">◇</div><h3>Reusable workflow resources</h3><p>Explore a growing library of templates and playbooks to make your operations more consistent.</p><a class="text-link" href="/toolkit/">Explore the toolkit →</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap banner"><div><h2>Turn your next client project into a repeatable process.</h2><p>Start with a checklist you can edit, copy and use today.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/onboarding/">Build my checklist ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
